<p dir="auto" data-start="96" data-end="199"><strong data-start="96" data-end="141">1. આ image ને તમારા computer માં save કરો</strong> (right-click → <strong data-start="157" data-end="175">Save image as…</strong>) અને નામ આપો:<br>
<code data-start="190" data-end="199">GUI.png</code></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="201" data-end="272"><strong data-start="201" data-end="272">2. GitHub → <code data-start="215" data-end="240">Digital-Library-Manager</code> → <code data-start="243" data-end="253">Add file</code> → <code data-start="256" data-end="270">Upload files</code></strong></p>
